    LLM: 'Players are dealt 4 cards in two batches. Betting proceeds with players able to bet, call, or fold. The strongest hands are Four of a Kind and the Banda (four cards of same suit). The hand rankings follow a hierarchy similar to Poker but adapted for the 32-card deck.',
